This repository contains a Hermes Agent plugin and benchmark tooling for LightOn's ColGrep
and ColGrep-Agent-2B.

The plugin's model-facing guidance text (hermes-colgrep/guidance.py) is adapted from
colgrep's Claude Code hooks (colgrep/src/commands/hooks.rs) in lightonai/next-plaid,
Copyright LightOn, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
https://github.com/lightonai/next-plaid

ColGrep-Agent-2B (lightonai/colgrep-agent-2B) and LateOn-Code-edge are LightOn models,
Apache-2.0. Neither model weights nor colgrep source are redistributed here.

The benchmark tasks reference public commits of NousResearch/hermes-agent (MIT); the
gold_fix.patch files are excerpts of those upstream commits, included for grading.
